e_name": "screenshot02.png", "id": "1167270421589414", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393425_1167270424922747_1907140739452079368_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=i6g1KN8nglUQ7kNvwGNixm0&_nc_oc=AdqNwz3DgaFYXnnx67WXLlwU3wNPQn5cX5oF-36AjUpkoARqfvloEhn00wZ0TUuNwQk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9v7pptgWvpRD9AVeZ_e5WzsXeWSjX-ND4WB1uQ4AtEnQ&oe=6A3409F9"}, {"file_name": "screenshot03.png", "id": "1320236425766559", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392005_1320236429099892_7026969068655260219_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NGTLZ8_V4cgQ7kNvwEKXKsg&_nc_oc=AdpSUS05W6B2FiTlVrtoyldVqjh0VAVAuQvbPUVvcq44UW66-Lz-0di6-BcAUzOOoQI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-t64xdugucYW2QMDDlDsjJKyrA9lxoE1kGc-WdBaeCuA&oe=6A341993"}, {"file_name": "screenshot04.png", "id": "1408931723813604", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391949_1408931727146937_1574658016866773147_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VvDmwWkOOqgQ7kNvwFNLY9-&_nc_oc=AdrXeKSy3VaEi1Xvz8NsyQ7f4rxm4xdwoTxpEA2JXgdZg03mymW6Zpbu100DVjzEw1A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8TyPh5rZzYKokk27EkxBlJY-iz7sIhkwYxMkJt2VSnlA&oe=6A33ECFB"}, {"file_name": "screenshot05.png", "id": "418176134719567", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391998_418176138052900_6204508764481913331_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-gNeXePulRoQ7kNvwH46bER&_nc_oc=AdqEQpV7S6AVpt47j4SF4U1M2nxttdmLMepSHbMQoqMAkpYgZT_Ll5gngnbXRKe9xlE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-OGY3GHe_7fk-Xj57lalisEN6RxzzS1tHMB9oPxgwYWg&oe=6A33EE4A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "thumbnail2.png", "id": "1152565683077389", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391896_1152565689744055_250834400001166292_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ICsA8lT0ig4Q7kNvwFZOSzz&_nc_oc=AdrdcJWTx7lskjcI2nMTmixpsNkDKgjPy3RlZOEm1OiGhvSk23JgXqOv5HhGx-Zuz88&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_Ssv5RvyoHWbN3-sB-e1JjoAAya8oipzxGvvz4Koenog&oe=6A340FBE"}, "display_name": "Aerodrums 2", "keywords": [], "long_description": "This is the companion app for the Aerodrums 2 air drumming instrument (sold separately). Seamlessly connect to your Aerodrums 2 device over WiFi and see your drum kit materialize before your eyes. Choose your kit, jam to your favorite tunes, practice with a metronome, or record your performances. No Aerodrums 2? No problem! The app will let you play a basic drum kit in mixed reality using hand-tracking.\n\nAerodrums 2 is an expressive and versatile air drumming instrument. It is a standalone device that uses high-speed optical motion capture technology to accurately track the position of your drumsticks and feet in 3D. Unlike acoustic and traditional electronic drum sets, Aerodrums 2 is lightweight and portable, it is silent when used with headphones, and it takes up no space when not in use.\n\nPaired with Meta Quest headsets, Aerodrums 2 offers an unparalleled drumming experience. Passthrough mode and depth occlusion let you see your real hands and drumsticks while drumming, while hand-tracking is used to further improve stick-tracking accuracy.\n\nTo learn more about Aerodrums 2 visit aerodrums.com", "short_description": "This is the companion app for the Aerodrums 2 air drumming instrument (sold separately). Seamlessly connect to your Aerodrums 2 device over WiFi and see your drum kit materialize before your eyes. Choose your kit, jam to your favorite tunes, practice with a metronome, or record your performances. No Aerodrums 2? No problem! The app will let you play a basic drum kit in mixed reality using hand-tracking."}]}, "developer_name": "Aerodrums", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://aerodrums.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_se